{"id":555,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"SSコンピテンシーを育む探究型SSH教育","feature_description":"芝浦工業大学柏中学校はSSHの指定校として、探究を軸に科学的な見方や課題解決力を育てています。教育では、主体性、協働、論理的思考などのSSコンピテンシーを掲げ、教科横断の学びや探究活動に取り組みます。大学や地域と連携する機会も用意し、生徒が自ら課題を見つけ、考え、表現する学びを進めています。SSHでは科学技術に関する探究課題に取り組み、成果を共有する機会も設けています。","clubs":[{"id":10571,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ka.shibaura-it.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10572,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ka.shibaura-it.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10573,"name":"水泳部（競泳・水球）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ka.shibaura-it.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10574,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ka.shibaura-it.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10575,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ka.shibaura-it.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10576,"name":"コンピューター部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ka.shibaura-it.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10577,"name":"鉄道研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.ka.shibaura-it.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13876,"name":"バスケットボール部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ka.shibaura-it.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13877,"name":"バレーボール部（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ka.shibaura-it.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13878,"name":"ハンドボール部（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ka.shibaura-it.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13879,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ka.shibaura-it.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13880,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ka.shibaura-it.ac.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},